1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:03,352
Now if I play "extract,"
it would be cheating.

2
00:00:03,549 --> 00:00:06,019
(Leonard:)- Sorry.
- Although, I could play...

3
00:00:06,218 --> 00:00:10,348
(Sheldon:)...the completely unrelated
and better word "extract."

4
00:00:12,658 --> 00:00:15,188
(Sheldon:)Ethical conundrum avoided.

5
00:00:16,295 --> 00:00:17,855
(Sheldon:)Thanks, brain.

6
00:00:20,699 --> 00:00:22,169
(Penny:)Spaghetti okay?

7
00:00:22,368 --> 00:00:24,168
(Leonard:)It's crunchy.

8
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:26,300
(Leonard:)Just the way I like it.

9
00:00:27,773 --> 00:00:30,713
(Penny:)Yeah, I don't think
the water was really boiling.

10
00:00:32,211 --> 00:00:33,871
- It's great, I love it.
- Ha, ha.

11
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:36,669
(Penny:)Okay, listen, there's something
I need to tell you.

12
00:00:37,282 --> 00:00:40,372
(Penny:)I've been thinking about
going back to school for a while now.

13
00:00:40,552 --> 00:00:43,882
(Penny:)So a couple months ago, I started taking
a history class at the community college.

14
00:00:44,056 --> 00:00:47,046
(Leonard:)Oh. That's great. Great, great, great.

15
00:00:47,226 --> 00:00:49,056
(Leonard:)- Why wait so long to tell me?
- I just...

16
00:00:49,228 --> 00:00:51,028
(Penny:)I don't want you to make
a big deal out of it.

17
00:00:51,196 --> 00:00:53,726
Why do you think that?
I get it, you're taking one class.

18
00:00:53,899 --> 00:00:56,769
(Leonard:)It's nice. Maybe if it goes well,
you take another, you enroll full time.

19
00:00:56,935 --> 00:01:00,395
(Leonard:)Ooh. Be sure to keep an eye on which
credits transfer to a four-year college.

